_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.6.dev1, 4.5.stable, 4.5.beta7 and later snapshots\n- Not reproducible in 4.5.beta6 and earlier snapshots\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.dev1 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8129) - AMD Ryzen 7 5700X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 15.92 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen editing a color in the inspector through a ```ColorPickerButton``` and pressing escape **_after_** the color picker popup has already been closed, the color will still be reverted back to the previous color. I understand that this is intended behavior while the popup is **open**, but started happening even when it's closed after 4.5.beta7. Reopening the popup and closing it again fixes the issue until the color is changed again.\n\nI have already identified what causes the issue and will be making a PR to address it.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a scene with a node that has a ```ColorPickerButton``` in it's inspector (e.g. a ```ColorRect```).\nOpen the color picker popup and change the color to something else.\nClose the popup by pressing Enter or by clicking out of it while making sure the inspector stays on the current node.\nPress Escape while the cursor is outside of the inspector to deselect the current node.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[color-picker-reverting-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22695777/color-picker-reverting-mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111245/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111245/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}